- Meet session browse's <200 ms warm-start target. Universal CLI imports and
  SQLAlchemy-backed index loading dominate; keep one command registration and read
  path instead of adding a parallel fast CLI loader.
- `spawn list --all` silently drops the default limit from 20 to 5, so a plain
  `--all` hint shows only five finished spawns. Either make `--all` mean all or
  document the cap; until then, callers must pass `--view all --limit N` explicitly.
